        "bug-stdio-ignore-blocked-stdin",
        "fix-optionA-prompt-file",
        "fix-optionB-placeholder-stdin",
        "fix-optionC-tempfile-stdin",
        "fix-applied-pipeStdin"
      ],
      "relation": "conceptually_related_to",
      "description": "The ENAMETOOLONG regression was caused by stdio:['ignore','pipe','pipe'] blocking stdin delivery for large prompts. Three fix options were evaluated (--prompt-file, placeholder+stdin, tempfile+stdin). The applied fix uses pipeStdin + stdio:['pipe','pipe','pipe'] to write/end child.stdin with the full task. Validated with 16831-char reviewer prompt via fake Pi CLI.",
      "source_file": "HANDOFF_VERIFIER_FIX.md"
    },
