        "bug-issue3-verifier-trusts-text",
        "bug-issue5-no-artifact-verification",
        "evidence-zero-files",
        "concept-planner-workaround-agent-coder"
      ],
      "relation": "conceptually_related_to",
      "description": "The orchestration failure cascade: Issue 1 forces planner to burn 2 attempts working around routing check (11 subagent spawns wasted). Issue 4 causes oversize tasks that saturate executor context, producing reports instead of code. Issue 3 causes verifier to trust those text reports. Issue 5 has no file-level check. Result: 18 subagents, 3 attempts, 1 hour, 0 files — and a PASS verdict.",
      "source_file": "HANDOFF.md"
    },
