      "relation": "conceptually_related_to",
      "description": "Subagent process lifecycle: agent_end signals task completion, but message_end with stopReason=error can arrive after agent_end during internal shutdown. The agentEnded flag fix ignores post-agent_end message_end errors, preventing false fatal crashes. Implemented in spawnSubagent() in substrate.ts.",
      "source_file": "HANDOFF.md"
