      "relation": "conceptually_related_to",
      "description": "The intake contract normalizer processes user task text through a pipeline: inferModelRoutingFromTask scans for model mentions, modelAliasFromText matches via regex, applyRoutingAlias maps to roles. The first-found alias wins with no role-specific override, and the resulting contract becomes the governing specification — even when it contradicts user intent. All components reside in src/index.ts.",
